<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA 241-4 AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 241-4 AT CLOSE V W.INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 241 for four (R.Dravid 92, S.Tendulkar 83) in their first innings at the close on the fourth-day of the rain-ruined fifth and final test match against West Indies on Sunday.</p>
</text>
